      "toleranceNote": "acos/sin/cos compound through divisions; JS engine vs Rust-libm-in-wasm may differ by ulps. Negation uses binary 0.0 - b.x (not unary minus) so zero components stay positive zero under the fail-closed lanes.",
      "tolerance": 1e-15,
      "statements": [
